    "radiusM": 32,
    "labelZoom": 15,
    "zoom": 17,
    "wiki": "Azadi Tower",
    "description": [
     "A 45-metre gateway faced with white marble, opened on 16 October 1971 for the 2,500-year celebrations. Its name means 'Remembrance of the Shahs'. The architect, Hossein Amanat, was in his twenties.",
